name=X6886 GPU DVFS governor
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=lemonrsh
description=Load-following GPU floor for MT6789/GED: raises the boost floor while the GPU is busy (UI, games, video) and releases it when idle. Ceiling and DVFS are untouched; reversible with one command or a reboot.
